					"content": "进行突破挑战！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706660102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706660102,
					"content": "#喵…「哎呀，要来进行牌手等级突破的试炼吗…嗯，{NICKNAME}确实已经拥有了挑战的资格，那我这就…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706660103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「小王子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 706660103,
					"content": "「这就让恕筠准备突破试炼所用的牌局吧，可要小心应对呀…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「小王子」"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7066702,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7066703
			],
